Package: com.you.liquidglasslock
Name: LiquidGlassLock
Version: 1.0.0-2
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: iOS 26 Liquid Glass for the lock screen only. Real-time Metal glass on notification/banner platters, quick actions, clock and passcode. No Home Screen / App Library / Dock / Widgets injection, so it never hits the "other surfaces go black" conflict.
Maintainer: Ray835999
Author: dylv (Liquidass), Ray835999 (lockscreen-only fork)
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
